Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Add=20"Check=20In=20/=20Start=20Day"=20button?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20pick=20dealer=20after,=20not=20before?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Flips the check-in flow around per user feedback: previously a rep had
to open a specific dealer's page to find the check-in button. Now the
Sales dashboard shows a prominent "Check In / Start Day" button (only
when not already checked in somewhere); tapping it opens a new
pick-a-dealer screen (search + list from get_my_dealers()), then the
duty-on photo capture, then calls start_dealer_visit() same as before
and lands on that dealer's detail page. The original per-dealer check-in
UI on the dealer detail screen is left in place for reps who navigate
there directly.

Extracted the duty-on/board/shop/card photo capture UI into a shared
src/components/staff/PhotoSlot.jsx so both entry points use the same
component instead of duplicating it.

